<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>NOT WORKING (expected). Its parent, the download recipe, is expected to stop at its first run (see the parent's Description), so this recipe publishes nothing (the first run, on 2026-10-04, stopped at the parent's provider, as expected). Hands the downloaded LibreOffice installer to CimianImporter, which publishes it as a new version of the item into a Cimian repository (as a copy of the item's newest pkginfo, with what belongs to the installer file replaced), or says that nothing is new. The recipe gives no version label: CimianImporter takes the MSI's own ProductVersion (read with msiinfo), and a label made from the release's three numbers could be refused. This is a dry run, which writes nothing, until the recipe's override sets cimian_dry_run to false. The repository is the input cimian_repo or the AutoPkg preference CIMIAN_REPO.</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.cimian.LibreOffice</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>CIMIAN_NAME</key>
            <string>libreoffice-fresh</string>
            <key>CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY</key>
            <string></string>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>LibreOffice</string>
            <key>pkginfo</key>
            <dict>
                <key>developer</key>
                <string>The Document Foundation</string>
                <key>display_name</key>
                <string>LibreOffice</string>
            </dict>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>ParentRecipe</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.LibreOffice-Win</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.SharedProcessors/CimianImporter</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                    <key>cimian_name</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_NAME%</string>
                    <key>cimian_subdirectory</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY%</string>
                    <key>version</key>
                    <string></string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
